Subject: [PATCH 18/26] No-CPU 1v1: OneOnOneWorlds (default 20 = Fes 1on1) ->
 2-client rooms, group 0 vs 1, matched at once

Every results hang tonight was 2 humans + 2 game-made CPU seats in a 2v2-rule room (the server
already sends only the 2 humans; CpuStandInSeats is off); the one 4-human 2v2 cleared results.
Fes 1on1 (mode 0x13 -> world 20) is the game's own 1v1 rule with no CPU seats. Solo searches there
pair first-come (never shuffled into a 2v2, no fill timer, no stand-ins); team entries refused.
OneOnOneWorlds="" restores the old 2v2 handling. 10 tests.

