--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 # Server-Infinite 1.2.0 for IBv13 (芽衣版本)
 
+> **Disclaimer — 2v2 matchmaking:** Matches in 2v2 modes only form when at least 4 human players are searching. The matchmaker does not add CPU partners or fill empty seats with CPUs. With fewer than 4 players, each cabinet times out after about 150 seconds, returns to practice mode, and can search again. Fes 1on1 (world 20) needs only 2 players.
+>
+> **声明（2v2 匹配）：** 2v2 模式仅在至少 4 名真人玩家同时搜索时才会组局，不会使用 CPU 搭档或补位。人数不足时，各机台约 150 秒后超时并回到练习模式，可再次搜索。Fes 1on1（world 20）只需 2 名玩家。
+
+
